      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "There are some misunderstandings.\n> Open source.\nThe asset is *NOT* open source. It's provided under the Standard Unity Asset Store EULA.\n> $80 cost.\nThe asset is \"Extension Asset\" thus the cost depends on the number of developers. If there are 30 developers, the cost will be $80 x 30 = $2,400.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
      "_id": "62edf5ab606e6e44bb01d1a4",
      "author": {
        "_id": "5f2cd4fb3e5e4b3102c12184",
        "alias": "Unexpected Marmot",
        "aliasID": "65c287d8ed6eefce4c747364",
