      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "If you are going to do it, you should try to use it in conjunction with EAC. (Worst case scenario, so that we can roll back if a failure occurs when installing a new anti-cheat tool)\nThe combination of anti-cheat tools is practiced by ApexLegends with EAC and Hyperion.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
