      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5f643d20b679b323d2ce9c0c|full_name}: 正直、一年くらいは同時にガードしながら一個ずつEACの役割を減らしていって、減らした結果セキュリティを破られたらその部分は差し戻しでいいと思います。\nリリースしてからしばらく運用して、様子を見るべきだと思います。\nFrankly, I think we should reduce the role of the EAC one by one while guarding it at the same time for a year or so, and if security is breached as a result of the reduction, that part should be replaced.\nI think we should operate it for a while after release and see how it goes.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
