      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "August 11, 2022, it's too late to that VRChat update ToS and privacy policy, but they did it anyway.\n  From what I've read in that update, it doesn't seem like what the EAC is doing is needlessly scary.\n  Well, that doesn't mean that subject has been outdated.\n  Even now, Anti-Cheat Toolkit(ACTk) is better than EAC.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
