  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "*I make my position clear, I HATE some mods as world creator.\n As is known, EAC include security risks. It's completely black box, freeware, and furthermore, yet it's kernel level software.\n So much for EAC spookiness, let's get down to business.\n ACTk has been there for a long time. It's published on Unity assets store.\nhttps://assetstore.unity.com/packages/tools/utilities/anti-cheat-toolkit-2021-202695?aid=1011lGBp&pubref=forum&utm_campaign=unity_affiliate&utm_medium=affiliate&utm_source=partnerize-linkmaker#description\n \nPro: \n Not kernel level.(No need UAC notification screen. = windows reduces risk)\n Total freedom of adjustment.\n Open source.\n $80 worth of support(*EAC is $0).\nCons:\n Old assets.\n Open source.\n =Easy to bypass.(But this is a matter of degree.)\n $80 cost.",
